<div class="hero"><div><span class="pill">.NET C# PROJECT</span><h1>AI-Based Employee<br>Leave Management</h1><p>Apply for leave, store records, manage approvals, and analyze leave patterns with actionable suggestions.</p><a class="btn" href="/Leaves/Create">Apply for Leave</a></div></div>
<div class="cards"><div><b>@ViewBag.Employees</b><span>Employees</span></div><div><b>@ViewBag.Leaves</b><span>Total Requests</span></div><div><b>@ViewBag.Pending</b><span>Pending</span></div><div><b>@ViewBag.ApprovedDays</b><span>Approved Days</span></div></div>
<section class="panel"><h2>AI Leave Pattern Analysis</h2><p class="muted">Rule-based analysis of stored leave data. This can later be connected to an ML/LLM API.</p><ul>@foreach(var x in (IEnumerable<string>)ViewBag.Insights){<li>@x</li>}</ul></section>
